                    %mi N
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N
              be an object satisfying the two colimit conditions of Freyd. First one shows (see the lemma
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#Peano"}
              below) that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
